---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Convert a curl command (an argument, or stdin) into a request file

Usage: rustman import curl [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]...

Arguments:
  [COMMAND]...
          The curl command: one quoted argument, or its words after `--`

Options:
      --out <FILE>
          Write the request file here instead of printing it (never overwrites)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
